\textbf{Our goal} \emph{is to design watermarks that optimally use  side information to maximize detection accuracy and minimize distortion of generated text.} 
%
%
%We propose two watermarks that differ by the outputs of the employed score function, both presenting competitive performance relative to state-of-the-art (see Figure \ref{fig:fig1}). 
