The proof of Theorem~\ref{ach} is given in Appendix~\ref{apdx:proof_thm_2}. 
Together, Theorems~\ref{thm:converse_upperbound_binary} and~\ref{ach}~imply that \simplexwater{} is minimax optimal among all watermarks with binary-valued score functions in the low-entropy regime.
