\title{\LARGE \bf
Preserving Sense of Agency: User Preferences for \newline Robot Autonomy and User Control across Household Tasks \thanks{This project was supported by the National Institute of Biomedical Imaging and Bioengineering (NIBIB) grant \#1R01EB034580-01 ``NRI: Adaptive Teleoperation Interfaces for In-Home Assistive Robots" and the National Science Foundation (NSF) grant \#2313998 ``Computer and Information Science and Engineering Graduate Fellowship".}}


