The evaluation surfaced the many different perspectives and domains that can mention aerospace terminology. We assigned different weights to each domain to facilitate the classification of in-scope and out-of-scope documents:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{5 strong match}: e.g. Aircraft design
    \item \textbf{4 weak match}: e.g. aerospace software development,
    aviation regulation and safety,
    aeronautics
