    lifecycle management,
    mission planning,
    pilot training,
    naval,
    air traffic management, air logistics
    \item \textbf{2 weak mismatch}: e.g. e-commerce
    \item \textbf{1 strong mismatch}: e.g. military, air force, warfare, command and control
\end{itemize}

