%

\noindent\textbf{project}(x, n\_comp=None)

Projects given $\mathbf{x}$ data to ECA space using specified number of $\mathbf{V}$ components. \textbf{project(y)} $\equiv$ \textbf{expand(transform(y))}.

\textbf{Parameters}:

\quad\textbf{x}: \textit{torch.Tensor} -- given $\mathbf{x}$ data.

\quad\textbf{n\_comp}: \textit{int} -- number of  $\mathbf{V}$ components to use for the transformation (None: use all available).

