\noindent\textbf{test}(x, y)

\indt For given ($\mathbf{x}, \mathbf{y}$) pair, calculates the covered variance $\rho(\mathbf{y}_\mathrm{pred}, \mathbf{y})$ between $\mathbf{y}$ and $\mathbf{y}_\mathrm{pred}$, predicted from the projection $\mathbf{x}'$ of $\mathbf{x}$ on ECA $\mathbf{V}$ space (see Eq.~\ref{R2}).

\textbf{Parameters}:

