      If $\sim$ is strong then  equality holds also for $\loops$, i.e.,
           \begin{center}
        \begin{tabular}{r@{\hspace{2pt}}c@{\hspace{2pt}}l}
          $\bsem{\loops}^{\As} \set{\frame{\sigma^{\sharp},
          \delta^{\sharp}} \concat S^{\sharp}}$ & $=$ &
          $\set{\frame{\sigma^{\sharp} \wedge \delta^{\sharp},
