  $\sem[]{\nexte}(\set{\mathsf{gs}}) = {\alpha_1}^s_{\ssim} \circ \sem[]{\nexte}
  \circ \gamma \circ {\alpha_1}^s_{\ssim} (\set{\mathsf{gs}}) = b \land c$. 
