g\left( \lambda  \right)=\underset{x,y}{\mathop{\inf }}\,\left( \underset{j\in M}{\mathop{\max }}\,{{y}_{j}}+\underset{j=1}{\overset{m}{\mathop \sum }}\,{{\lambda }_{j}}\left( {{\beta}_{j}}-\alpha_{j}^{T}x-{{y}_{j}} \right) \right)
