\underset{j\in M}{\mathop{\max }}\,{{y}_{j}}-\sum\limits_{j\in M}{{{\lambda }_{j}}{{y}_{j}}}=t{{\left( 1-{{1}^{T}}\lambda  \right)}^{t\to \infty ,{{1}^{T}}\lambda \ne 1}}\to -\infty 
