In Table~\ref{tab:pre-rerank}, we observe an interesting phenomenon. Before applying \textbf{LLM reranking}, \textbf{BGE-Large} slightly outperforms \textbf{MiniLM-v6} across all metrics, particularly in \textbf{nDCG@10}. However, after reranking with \textbf{GPT-4o}, the performance advantage shifts:

