(iv) \emph{Pairwise statistical features}, such as $\mathsf{Cov}(\mathbf{g}, \mathbf{g}')$. After careful experimentation, we conclude that the $\cos_p(\mathbf{g},\mathbf{g}')$ for $p \in [4]$ provides the most accurate and robust user selection performance. 

