\subsection{Validation of control co-design offshore wind farm using simulations (PSCAD)}

In Figure~\ref{fig:ks99}, we present the plot of the droop control variable $k$ at COTWDPGE for scenario 80 in case CCD18-3. The pink band illustrates the distribution of this variable across all scenarios. For most of the time, the ESS variable is at its upper limit. By adjusting the droop status of the wind farm and ESS, the system optimizes its output while ensuring sufficient reserve for frequency support.
