$\epsilon$ & Small positive constant (error tolerance in Theorem~\ref{theorem:2}). \\
\midrule
\multicolumn{2}{l}{\textit{\textbf{Modulation and training variables}}} \\
$R^k$ & Shared base coefficient matrix for layer $k$. \\
$\alpha^k$  & Modulation vector for layer $k$ \\
