$\psi_k(\cdot)$  & Modulation function applied at layer $k$ \\
$z$ & Latent modulation vector (sample-specific) \\
$g_a(z;\pi_a)$ & Mapping for function space $\mathcal{A}$: generates $\{\alpha^a_k\}_{k=1}^L$ from latent $z$. \\
